{% doc %}
  PDP delivery information block (free-UK-delivery cutover, 2026-07-03):
  honest sticker price + transparent delivery BEFORE checkout. UK delivery is
  free on EVERY order - checkout charges GBP 0 for the UK on all shipping
  profiles (the item's freight is baked into the sticker by PawScout's pricing
  rule), so there is no threshold and no standard rate to disclose.

  Delivery estimate: PawScout writes a per-product order->door range (calendar
  days, e.g. "6-21") into supplier.delivery_days from the synced CJ logistics
  matrix. When present it's shown verbatim; when blank (stale / not yet synced)
  a conservative static window is shown. Rule: only surface what is real and
  defensible - the synced figure when we have it, a conservative window otherwise.
  @param {product} product - Product being viewed
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign delivery_days = product.metafields.supplier.delivery_days.value
-%}

<div class="delivery-info" aria-label="Delivery information">
  <ul class="di-rows">
    <li>
      <strong>FREE UK delivery</strong> on every order
    </li>
    <li>
      Estimated
      {%- if delivery_days != blank %} {{ delivery_days }} days{%- else %} 8-21 days{%- endif %} to your door
    </li>
    <li>
      14-day returns &middot; <a href="/policies/refund-policy">see our returns policy</a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>
